1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,679
Most people assume that happiness

2
00:00:01,679 --> 00:00:04,139
and unhappiness are opposites. If

3
00:00:04,139 --> 00:00:04,900
you have more of one,

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:05,919
you have less of the

5
00:00:05,919 --> 00:00:07,179
other. It's on a dial,

6
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,320
basically. But that's wrong. In

7
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,140
truth, happiness and unhappiness are

8
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,740
separate systems. Researchers confirmed this

9
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,119
in 1988 with a tool

10
00:00:15,119 --> 00:00:17,320
called PANIS, the Positive and

11
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:19,519
Negative Affect Schedule. You get

12
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:21,879
two independent scores. Your positive

13
00:00:21,879 --> 00:00:23,320
affect and your negative affect.

14
00:00:23,579 --> 00:00:24,440
You can run high on

15
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,640
both. You can run low

16
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,940
on both. Most people have

17
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,339
spent their entire lives trying

18
00:00:28,339 --> 00:00:29,760
to manage one dial. They

19
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,280
didn't know they had and

20
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,219
completely ignoring the other. Mother

21
00:00:33,219 --> 00:00:34,399
Nature built it this way

22
00:00:34,399 --> 00:00:36,439
on purpose. Negative emotions are

23
00:00:36,439 --> 00:00:38,159
a survival system. They keep

24
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:40,119
you scanning for threats. Positive

25
00:00:40,119 --> 00:00:42,039
emotions push you toward opportunity.

26
00:00:42,439 --> 00:00:43,420
Those are two different systems.

27
00:00:43,799 --> 00:00:45,840
The ancients understood this intuitively.

28
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,200
Ecclesiastes speaks of a time

29
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,399
to weep and a time

30
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:51,060
to laugh, both belonging to

31
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,799
a full life. My negative

32
00:00:52,799 --> 00:00:54,960
dial runs pretty hot. For

33
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,320
years, I assumed that meant

34
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,359
something was wrong with me,

35
00:00:57,479 --> 00:00:58,659
but it doesn't. It means

36
00:00:58,659 --> 00:00:59,920
I have a specific setting

37
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:00,960
and it's not a malfunction.

38
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:03,079
And knowing that changed what

39
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:04,299
I was actually working on

40
00:01:04,299 --> 00:01:05,819
day to day. I stopped

41
00:01:05,819 --> 00:01:08,400
trying to manufacture cheerfulness and

42
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,780
I started managing the negative

43
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:12,180
dial through sleep, exercise, and

44
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:13,579
food. Not turning it to

45
00:01:13,579 --> 00:01:15,939
zero, but managing it. That's

46
00:01:15,939 --> 00:01:18,340
the unglamorous machinery of a

47
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:19,920
good life. The wellness industry

48
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,140
will sell you the idea

49
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:22,560
that feeling better and feeling

50
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,719
less bad are the same

51
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:25,060
project. They're not the same

52
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:26,359
project. And if you try

53
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:28,480
to eliminate your unhappiness entirely,

54
00:01:29,019 --> 00:01:30,799
you will eliminate your happiness

55
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:31,879
with it. So the first

56
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:33,319
step is knowing your positive

57
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:35,280
and negative affect numbers. Not

58
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,859
to fix them, to understand

59
00:01:36,859 --> 00:01:38,879
what you're exactly working with,

60
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,200
and to make the correct

61
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,939
changes. You can't be happy,

62
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:43,519
but you can be happier,

63
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:45,379
but not by turning the

64
00:01:45,379 --> 00:01:45,859
wrong dial.
